{
    "word": "inevitability",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "674744b3-ce40-3af8-8932-2674fc0b3334",
                "word": "inevitability",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "3d656dcf-5035-4d16-a9b2-b6d954e8f536",
                        "entry_id": "674744b3-ce40-3af8-8932-2674fc0b3334",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "inevitabilities"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "63dc2c67-7103-322b-b996-f29ad6b9de30",
                        "entry_id": "674744b3-ce40-3af8-8932-2674fc0b3334",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The condition of being inevitable."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b2eeb36a-e773-48d9-b3bc-ec3738e8c57c",
                                "sense_id": "63dc2c67-7103-322b-b996-f29ad6b9de30",
                                "text": "Now, cramped and outclassed as Euston has become, rebuilding hangs over it with an awful inevitability."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "77ba60bb-026f-4b87-a121-1a53403d4095",
                                "sense_id": "63dc2c67-7103-322b-b996-f29ad6b9de30",
                                "text": "Surveillance capitalism is a human creation. It lives in history, not in technological inevitability."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aebd9271-04a6-4e6a-bd78-921654eb799e",
                                "sense_id": "63dc2c67-7103-322b-b996-f29ad6b9de30",
                                "text": "Manchester United's 27-year-old captain cut a distracted and chaotic figure as he endured a personal nightmare, its conclusion with a red card carrying an air of inevitability from the moment he recklessly launched himself at Yussuf Poulsen to pick up an early yellow."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "06810141-0240-327f-94d5-74540bd48645",
                        "entry_id": "674744b3-ce40-3af8-8932-2674fc0b3334",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An inevitable condition or outcome."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "324f3f4b-85c7-4550-b207-0ce546e416e8",
                        "source_entry_id": "674744b3-ce40-3af8-8932-2674fc0b3334",
                        "source_sense_description": "the condition of being inevitable",
                        "target_lang_word": "onvermijdelijkheid",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "onvermijdelijkheid",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f166d7e6-55cd-3483-840f-492e91ae906f",
                                        "entry_id": "7d67d0b0-3562-34ee-a031-f2e817e5d16b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "de mate waarin iets noodzakelijk is"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2518b1c-0b14-45ed-bcd1-8eddbc96955c",
                                                "sense_id": "f166d7e6-55cd-3483-840f-492e91ae906f",
                                                "text": "Een eenmaal verrichte daad is onherroepelijk, en wanneer die handeling in de tijd samenvalt met miljoenen handelingen van andere mensen, krijgt ze een historische betekenis. Hoe hoger de mens op de maatschappelijke ladder staat en met hoe meer mensen hij verbonden is, des te meer macht hij over andere mensen heeft, en des te duidelijker de voorbeschiktheid en de onvermijdelijkheid van elk van zijn daden is."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5959d0a2-9e40-4fdb-973b-f2228e3542de",
                                                "sense_id": "f166d7e6-55cd-3483-840f-492e91ae906f",
                                                "text": "Hij gelooft niet dat een nieuw kabinet de crisis meteen zal oplossen, maar denkt wel dat het een goed begin zou zijn. \"We hebben nu het meest rechtse kabinet uit de parlementaire geschiedenis, dat heel hard bezig is om heel veel sociale voorzieningen en publieke diensten te slopen uit naam van onvermijdelijkheid\", aldus de woordvoerder."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3dc2ed43-302f-3ccb-b933-efbda422455c",
                                        "entry_id": "7d67d0b0-3562-34ee-a031-f2e817e5d16b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "iets noodzakelijks"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f08baab5-13a3-4e25-8db6-c590dd8ee7d1",
                        "source_entry_id": "674744b3-ce40-3af8-8932-2674fc0b3334",
                        "source_sense_description": "the condition of being inevitable",
                        "target_lang_word": "Unvermeidlichkeit",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Unvermeidlichkeit",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6991e5b6-420b-3015-b33b-44dee69637bb",
                                        "entry_id": "014f7170-2a82-38da-9a17-25b693510899",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Eigenschaft, unvermeidlich zu sein"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8057b851-9898-4d69-bc9c-32a3d15ffc9e",
                                                "sense_id": "6991e5b6-420b-3015-b33b-44dee69637bb",
                                                "text": "„Wie eine infizierte Wunde, deren Vorhandensein ich mir nicht eingestehen wollte, begann kurz nach dem Tod von Marcus Agrippa die Unvermeidlichkeit des Bevorstehenden in mir zu rumoren.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "329009ae-6635-43b9-8edf-2a80b4bc1cff",
                        "source_entry_id": "674744b3-ce40-3af8-8932-2674fc0b3334",
